.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Diophantus&#x27;s Arithmetica asks for whole-number solutions of equations with more unknowns than constraints. For the linear case ax + by = c, integer solutions exist exactly when \gcd(a, b) divides c, and then they form one infinite family spaced evenly along the line. This script solves 12x + 18y = 30, shows that 12x + 18y = 31 has no solution, and plots the integer points on the line.">

